// The development app, "Scraps Cache Dev": its own bundle ID, home-screen name
// and icon, so it installs beside the production app. Pass it to xcodebuild with
// `-xcconfig ios/App/Dev.xcconfig` (scripts/ios-testflight.sh does when
// IOS_VARIANT=dev); without it, every build is the production app.
//
// The App target reads these three settings; nothing else does, so overriding
// them for the whole build leaves the Swift packages' own identifiers alone.
APP_BUNDLE_ID = com.scrapscache.app.dev
APP_DISPLAY_NAME = Scraps Cache Dev
APP_ICON_NAME = AppIcon-Dev
